# Skill Dispatch — Food on the Run

This is a **pnpm + Turborepo monorepo** with three apps and shared TS:
- `apps/web` — customer-facing frontend (UmiJS + React + TypeScript + Tailwind + antd)
- `apps/admin` — internal back-office console (UmiJS + React + TypeScript + Tailwind + antd)
- `apps/server` — single Go + PostgreSQL backend serving both frontends
- `packages/shared` — `@food/shared`; pure TypeScript shared by **web + admin** only (see `monorepo-shared` skill)

Before writing any code, follow the steps below.

## Step 1 — Classify the Task

| What you are about to do | Skill to load |
|---|---|
| Create / modify / delete a React **component** or **page** under `apps/web/src/` OR `apps/admin/src/` | `component-conventions` **+** `ui-design-system` |
| Restyle, redesign, or add UI in `apps/web/src/` OR `apps/admin/src/` (including any antd `Table`, `Drawer`, `Modal`, `Form`, `Menu`, `Sider`) | `ui-design-system` |
| Add, rename, move, or delete any **file or folder** under `apps/web/src/` | `directory-structure` |
| Add, rename, move, or delete any **file or folder** under `apps/admin/src/` | `directory-structure-admin` |
| Add or modify an **API service function** under `apps/web/src/services/` or `apps/admin/src/services/` | `web-api-service` |
| Create / modify a **DB migration** (`.sql`), table, column, index, enum, or Go struct mapped to DB | `postgresql-naming-conventions` |
| Add or modify an HTTP **handler**, route, middleware, or any Go file under `apps/server/` | `go-server-conventions` |
| Add, rename, move, or delete any file under **`packages/shared/`** | `monorepo-shared` |

